<title>USA: Norwest buys Statewide Mortgage Co.</title>
<headline>Norwest buys Statewide Mortgage Co.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwest Corp said Friday it acquired  Statewide Mortgage Co, which specializes in underwriting, originating, selling and servicing property improvement loans insured by the Department of Housing and Urban Development.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Privately held Statewide, based in Birmingham, Ala., made about nine percent of all Federal Home Administration Title I loans originated last year and ranked third among all Title I lenders in loan volume in the fourth quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
